OL,3,GNEWSAWildlife trust wants marina silt
OL,4,Adisposed offshore
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wildlife trust has called for a new
OL,7,Foffshore disposal site to be found for
OL,8,Fsediment dredged from Brighton Marina,
OL,9,Fsaying it remains concerned about plans
OL,10,Fbeing explored off Newhaven.
OL,12,FBrighton Marina has been looking for a
OL,13,Flong-term disposal site since Sussex
OL,14,FWildlife Trust successfully challenged
OL,15,Fa licence in 2025 for disposal of
OL,16,Fsediment at Rottingdean.
OL,18,FThe marina has said dredging is needed
OL,19,Fto maintain safe access and there are
OL,20,Flimited options available for disposal
OL,21,Fsites.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
