OL,3,GNEWSAWildlife trust wants marina silt
OL,4,Adisposed offshore
OL,5,
OL,6,FSussex Wildlife Trust said Newhaven was
OL,7,Fa "protected area" that sat adjacent to
OL,8,Fthe Beachy Head West Marine
OL,9,FConservation Zone (MCZ).
